{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Confection Combat is a PvE sugar-based Shooter. Team up with your friends to fight armies of confection-based bad guys.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Silly Weapons: Choose from a variety of candy-based weapons including the Gummy Bear gun, Smore Launcher, Cane gun, Cane Cannon, Candy Corn Launcher and guided candy corn launcher.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Ridiculous enemies: Fight Gingerbread men, chocolate spiders, marshmallows and tanks made of graham crackers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Play online with up to 5 of your friends or play on your Local Area network (LAN). Need practice? Play a single player game and see how high of a score you can get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Explore 4 different battlefields each with its own unique features and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-NPCs too easy? Try playing Sugar Crash mode where the enemies, annoyed with your presence turn on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-No DLC packs and no paywalls, buy the game once and you have access to everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506560/extras/ShootingMainWeapon.png?t=1740146946\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506560/extras/ShotByTanks.png?t=1740146946\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3506560?t=1740146946","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506560/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740146946","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506560/60da7e4bac27d6c26c0b13e7450d98310a0c9825/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740146946","capsule_imagev5"